jobs.description:
About this role:

We’re looking for a Senior OutSystems Engineer who is versatile, enthusiastic, a great team player with a strong work ethic, eager to learn, and available to help others. We want creative individuals who cherish and contribute to an informal, high-performance, and collaborative work environment.

What You Will Do or Key Responsibilities:

Develop solutions following OutSystems low-code development best practices, ensuring solution performance and user adoption;

Design and develop solutions with the team by following development processes (like TDD, BDD, code reviews);
Produce and test code in short cycles with a high degree of automation;
Gather feedback from end-users and adapt solutions;
Focus on developing maintainable solutions that scale to thousands of users;
Experience in designing and communicating high-level functional designs and solutions;

Qualifications / What You Need To Succeed:

Degree in Computer Science or other STEM courses;
More than 2 years of OutSystems development experience and certifications;
More than 4 years of software development experience;
Proficiency in web-based languages: JavaScript, CSS, HTML;
Programming with databases: SQL Server, Oracle, or Postgres;
Knowledge in Database Modeling;
Experience in Agile methodologies practices;
Understanding of solution architecture and design, and web application performance;
Good communication skills. Fluency in English, written and spoken, is essential;
Good Customer Orientation and Interpersonal Skills;
Strong quality orientation and attention to detail.

